`,e.jsxs(t.p,{children:[e.jsx(t.code,{children:"Joint.currentForce"})," and ",e.jsx(t.code,{children:"currentTorque"})," expose solver constraint loads relative to ",e.jsx(t.code,{children:"connectedBody"})," when assigned, otherwise in world space. Record that frame and its pose with the sample; comparing raw vectors from differently oriented connections is not a common-frame comparison. These API pages establish neither an observation timestamp nor a complete accounting of every external/contact/actuator load. ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://docs.unity3d.com/6000.0/Documentation/ScriptReference/Joint-currentForce.html",children:"Force API"}),", ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://docs.unity3d.com/6000.0/Documentation/ScriptReference/Joint-currentTorque.html",children:"Torque API"})]}),`
`,e.jsxs(t.p,{children:[e.jsx(t.code,{children:"ArticulationBody.GetDriveForces(List<float>)"})," fills hierarchy-wide reduced-coordinate drive-force data and returns the DOF count. Use the same body/DOF mapping; this documented drive observation is not a whole-mechanism contact-wrench measurement. ",e.jsx(t.a,{href:"https://docs.unity3d.com/6000.0/Documentation/ScriptReference/ArticulationBody.GetDriveForces.html",children:"Drive-force readback"})]}),`
